<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Roboto&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="css/reset.css">
    <title>Coalbiters Club | Silent Book Club</title>
    <style>
      :root {
          --cb-color-black: black;
          --cb-color-blue: #5accff;
          --cb-color-gray: #e9e9ed;
          --cb-color-pink: #f9f;        
          --cb-color-yellow: yellow;
          --cb-color-screen: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
          --cb-padding: 1rem 2rem 1rem;
          --cb-padding-bottom: 1rem;
          --cb-padding-left-right: 2rem;
          --cb-padding-top: 1rem;
      }
      html {
          background: var(--cb-color-yellow);
          color: var(--cb-color-black);
          font-family: Roboto, Verdana, sans-serif;
          font-size: 16px;
          height: 100%;
          width: 100%;
      }
      body {
          min-height: 100vh;
          width: 100%;
          display: flex;
          flex-direction: column;
      }
      article, footer, header {
          width: 100%
      }
      article {
          align-items: center;
          display: flex;
          flex-grow: 1;
          justify-content: center;
     }
     section {
     margin: 2rem 0 2rem;
     padding-top: 0.5rem;
          border-top: 1px solid black;        
     }
      #nav {
          padding: var(--cb-padding);          
      }
      #nav li a {
          line-height: 2rem;
          text-decoration: underline dotted;
          color: var(--cb-color-black);
      }
      #nav li a:hover {
          text-decoration: 
      }
      #main {
          max-width: 400px;
          padding: var(--cb-padding);
      }
      #footer {
          font-size: 0.75rem;
          padding: var(--cb-padding);
          text-align: right;
      }
      #event-details {
          padding-top: 2rem;
          font-size: 1.5rem;
          line-height: 2.75rem;
      }
      .event-detail {
          display: block;
      }
      .event-title {
          font-size: 3rem;
          margin-bottom: 1rem;
      }
      .event-subtitle {
          font-size: 2rem;
      }
      .event-time {
          background: var(--cb-color-blue);
          padding: 0.25rem 0.50rem;
      }
      .event-location {
          line-height: 2rem;
      }
      .event-date {
          background: var(--cb-color-pink);
          padding: 0.25rem 0.50rem;
      }
      .hidden {
          display: none;
      }
      #ticket-selector {
          margin-top: 3rem;
          max-width: 600px;
          border-left: 2px solid black;
          border-top: 2px solid black;
          border-bottom: 2px solid black;
          display: flex;
          flex-direction: row;
          justify-content: center;
          height: 2.625rem;
      }
      #ticket-selector button {
          border: none;
          border-right: 2px solid black;
          font-size: 1rem;
          font-weight: bold;
          text-align: center;
      }
      #ticket-selector button:active {
          background: var(--cb-color-pink);
          color: var(--cb-color-black);
      }
      #email-input {
      border: none;
      padding-left: 1rem;
      flex-grow: 3;
      }
      #ticket-submit-button {
          flex-grow: 1;
          color: var(--cb-color-gray);
          background: black;
      }
      h2 {
      padding-top: 1.5rem;
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      }
      p {
      margin-top: 1rem;
      line-height: 1.25rem;
      }
      em {
      font-weight: bold;
      }
      .schedule {
      padding-top: 1rem;
      }
      dt:first-of-type {
      padding-top: 0;
      }
      dt {
      padding-top: 1rem;
      font-weight: bold;
      }
      dd {
      padding: 0.25rem 0;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <header>
      <nav id="nav">
        <ul>
          <li><a href="/">Silent Disco</a></li>
          <li><a href="/about">About Coalbiters</a></li>
        </ul>
      </nav>
    </header>
    <article>
      <div id="main">
        <h1 class="event-title">Introvert Happy Hour</h1>      
        <span class="event-subtitle">Silent Book Club</span>
        <div id="event-details">
          <span class="event-detail"><span class="event-time">5:30pm&ndash;7pm</span></span>
          <span class="event-detail">Thursday, <span class="event-date">July 31, 2025</span></span>
          <span class="event-detail event-location">Fiske Free Library, Claremont</span>
          </div><!-- end event-details -->
        <form id="ticket-selector" method="post" action="/event/signup">
          <input type="hidden" name="event_id" value="15">
          <input id="email-input" type="email" name="email" placeholder="Your email">
          <button type="submit" id="ticket-submit-button">
            <span>Sign Up</span>
          </button>
        </form><!-- end ticket-selector -->
        <section>
          <h2>What is a silent book club?</h2>
          <p>
            At a silent book club, friends and strangers gather monthly to share what they're reading
            and settle in for an hour of sustained, silent reading. At the end, readers can socialize&mdash;or not!
            There is <em>no assigned reading</em>. Bring your own book&mdash;or pick one out at the
            library. All readers are welcome. Book club events are <em>free</em>. 
          </p>
          <p>The club schedule looks like this:</p>
          <dl class="schedule">
            <dt>5:30&ndash;6pm</dt>
            <dd>Arrive, say hello and share what they've been reading</dd>
            
            <dt>6&ndash;7pm</dt>
            <dd>Quiet reading hour</dd>
            
            <dt>7pm</dt>
            <dd>Leave the library. Optional socializing elsewhere</dd>
          </dl>
          <h2>Is there an age limit?</h2>
          <p>
            No way! We encourage everyone to join the club. Families with children, older people, younger
            people, teens. We want you to come read with us!
          </p>
          <h2>Where is it?</h2>
          <p>
            We meet at <! in the Gilmore Room in the basement of --> the Fiske Free Library (<a href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/XhgBSPemMwgGBKDe7">map</a>) in Claremont, NH.
          </p>
        </section>        
      </div><!-- end main -->
    </article>
    <footer>
      <p id="footer">&copy;2025 Claremont Coalbiters Club</p>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>
